# Wild bosses (bosses/wild.js, `wild` tables in design/data/bosses.toml, story-characters.md section 5). Every `ttl boss expect`
# prints "ttl: ..." when it does not hold (counted as a failure by `server.sh test-all`). `ttl boss wild roll` prints
# "boss wild <id>: refused: ..." for a refusal; that is a plain line, not a failure.
# The natural roll (per-minute chance in a listed region) cannot be asserted in a short test: it is covered by `chance`/`wildregion`
# here and by the log line "[ttl] boss: wild <id> near <player> in <region>" when it fires for real. A manual roll skips the
# chance, region, weather, day caps and the wild cooldown but keeps max_active, max_instances and "already out there" (wild).
# Wild and story are separate (WP-W2): a story fight never blocks the roll and the roll never touches a party's cooldown.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] boss: wild shizu near TtlBotWildA in ..." (region name, or "uncharted land"), "[ttl] boss: shizu
# summoned (wild) (hp ...)", "[ttl] events: registered wild_boss" at start-up, and the announce line "A calamity stirs: Shizu, the
# Flame Tyrant roams ..." in chat for the Life 2 bot. Needs the Tensura world (the Overworld) and the event director (WP7).
ttlbot spawn TtlBotWildA
@sleep 2
gamemode creative TtlBotWildA
kubejs stages add TtlBotWildA ttl.life2
ttl boss reset TtlBotWildA
ttl boss abort
@sleep 2
# Tidy up after bosses.rcon (a story cooldown no longer blocks a wild roll; the clears only leave a known state).
ttl boss cooldown clear orc_lord
ttl boss cooldown clear shizu
ttl events expect registered wild_boss true
ttl events expect scheduled wild_boss false
ttl boss wild
# Odds: the O7 starting values; the path multiplier is per boss (Hinata x3 for dark-path souls, nobody else).
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance orc_lord 0.03
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance shizu 0.01
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance hinata_sakaguchi 0.005
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance gazel_dwargo 0
kubejs stages add TtlBotWildA ttl.path.dark
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance hinata_sakaguchi 0.015
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance shizu 0.01
kubejs stages remove TtlBotWildA ttl.path.dark
kubejs stages add TtlBotWildA ttl.path.light
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA chance hinata_sakaguchi 0.005
kubejs stages remove TtlBotWildA ttl.path.light
# Regions: Tempest (anchor `tempest`, design/data/anchors.toml) is Jura ('J'): Shizu and the Orc Lord roam there, Hinata does not.
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotWildA ${anchor:tempest.x} 100 ${anchor:tempest.z}
@sleep 1
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildregion shizu yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildregion orc_lord yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildregion hinata_sakaguchi no
# A manual roll near the bot: at the Life 2 arrival, 1,050 blocks from Tempest on Jura's rim, so the safe-zone margin does not
# refuse the spot (it is open ground, no build or domain within 24 blocks).
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotWildA ${anchor:arrival.x} 120 ${anchor:arrival.z}
@sleep 1
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA active shizu no
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildblock shizu no
ttl boss wild roll shizu TtlBotWildA
@sleep 6
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA active shizu yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wild shizu yes
execute in minecraft:overworld if entity @e[tag=ttl.boss,tag=ttl.bossid.shizu]
ttl boss list
# max_active = 1: a second wild boss is refused while one roams, and the same boss is "already out there".
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildblock orc_lord yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildblock shizu yes
ttl boss wild roll orc_lord TtlBotWildA
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA active orc_lord no
ttl boss wild
ttl boss abort shizu
@sleep 2
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA active shizu no
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildblock orc_lord no
# A summoned (quest or altar) boss is not a wild one and does not use up max_active.
ttl boss summon shizu
@sleep 4
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA active shizu yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wild shizu no
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildblock orc_lord no
# A story Shizu at Tempest does not block a wild Shizu (world-state.md H3): the roll starts and both are out at once.
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildblock shizu no
ttl boss wild roll shizu TtlBotWildA
@sleep 6
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wild shizu yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA story shizu yes
ttl boss list
ttl boss abort shizu
@sleep 2
# The fixed spawn stays: the summoned Shizu stood at Tempest's arena, the wild one near the bot (the log lines show both).
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA active shizu no
# The continent line (world-state.md §2.0): beyond the canon coast the mods' own spawns rule. Nothing of ours is summoned there
# (an ops summon is refused), no wild region reaches it, and block_natural does not cancel a natural boss spawn there (the log
# then says "spawn type=...: allowed (outside the continent)"; a natural spawn cannot be forced in a short test).
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotWildA 9000 120 0
@sleep 2
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA continent here no
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA summonhere orc_lord no
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA wildregion orc_lord no
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotWildA ${anchor:arrival.x} 120 ${anchor:arrival.z}
@sleep 2
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA continent here yes
ttl boss expect TtlBotWildA summonhere orc_lord yes
# Clean up.
ttl boss abort
ttl boss reset TtlBotWildA
kubejs stages remove TtlBotWildA ttl.life2
ttlbot remove TtlBotWildA
